%% UML Sequence Diagram: Deterministic Nutrition Calculation & Safe Calorie Floor Pipeline
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna as 👤 Pengguna
    participant UI as 📱 ProfileScreen / PortionInput
    participant Prov as 🔄 ProfileProvider / DashboardProvider
    participant Calc as ⚡ NutritionCalculator (Deterministik)
    participant Floor as 🛡️ SafeCalorieFloor Guard
    participant Atwater as ⚖️ AtwaterEngine (4P+4C+9F)
    participant Repo as 📦 ProfileRepository / MealRepository
    participant DB as 🔥 Cloud Firestore

    Pengguna->>UI: Masukkan Data Antropometri (Usia, BB, TB, Gender, Aktivitas)
    UI->>Prov: updatePersonalMetrics(profileData)
    Prov->>Calc: calculateBMR(weightKg, heightCm, ageYears, gender)
    Note over Calc: Mifflin-St Jeor: (10*W) + (6.25*H) - (5*A) + s (+5 Pria / -161 Wanita)
    Calc-->>Prov: Nilai BMR (kkal/hari)

    Prov->>Calc: calculateTDEE(bmr, activityMultiplier)
    Note over Calc: TDEE = BMR * (1.20 | 1.375 | 1.55 | 1.725)
    Calc-->>Prov: Nilai TDEE Baseline

    Prov->>Floor: applySafeCalorieFloor(tdee, deficitGoal, gender)
    Note over Floor: Guard: min 1500 kkal (Pria) / 1200 kkal (Wanita)
    Floor-->>Prov: Target Kalori Terverifikasi Aman

    Prov->>Atwater: calculateMacroSplit(targetCalories)
    Note over Atwater: Karbo 50% (kal/4) | Protein 20% (kal/4) | Lemak 30% (kal/9)
    Atwater-->>Prov: Target Makronutrien (Carbs_g, Protein_g, Fat_g)

    Prov->>Repo: saveNutritionTargets(uid, calorieTarget, macros)
    Repo->>DB: Atomic Update /users/:uid
    DB-->>Repo: Sukses
    Repo-->>Prov: Model Profil Terbarukan
    Prov-->>UI: Re-render Hero Calorie Dial & Bento Grid Makro
    UI-->>Pengguna: Visualisasi Target Nutrisi Terbuka
